{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/858870/extras/6604903b9e3490dd4841c080dfc22830.poster.avif?t=1763649714\" width=570 height=44 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/858870/extras/6604903b9e3490dd4841c080dfc22830.webm?t=1763649714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/858870/extras/6604903b9e3490dd4841c080dfc22830.mp4?t=1763649714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Queen of Seas 2</strong> is a platform game based on elements of afro-brazilian culture. The fishermen\u2019s village has suffered several hardships in the past years and is losing faith in Yemanj\u00e1, its protective goddess. Player needs to bring hope back to the village, rescuing the villager\u2019s lost memories in the ocean floor to make faith in Yemanj\u00e1 return to the hearts of the residents.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/858870/extras/5d348146a338e80a89e3cc6d967f0ed8.poster.avif?t=1763649714\" width=570 height=44 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/858870/extras/5d348146a338e80a89e3cc6d967f0ed8.webm?t=1763649714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/858870/extras/5d348146a338e80a89e3cc6d967f0ed8.mp4?t=1763649714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy an unique and immersive storytelling<br></li><li>Choose between two different scuba diving suits<br></li><li>Make diving suit upgrades<br></li><li>Face seven different levels<br></li><li>Follow your path among sharks, oysters, jellyfishes, crabs and more<br></li><li>Explore a full habited village with side quests<br></li><li>Hear a full chiptunes original soundtrack</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/858870/extras/81cb4988f30080810839e6d29bff399b.webp?t=1763649714\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/858870/extras/81cb4988f30080810839e6d29bff399b.poster.avif?t=1763649714\" class=\"bb_img\" width=571 height=44 /></picture></span><br>Queen of Seas 2 won the App Pra Cultura public contest and was funded by brazilian Ministry of Culture.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"28ce0b1e06083ae7d289621f1cc566580425d24d.jpg","localized_name":"And the wave took it","name":"And the wave took it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/858870/28ce0b1e06083ae7d289621f1cc566580425d24d.jpg"},{"icon":"d3a6e2ec5a76b3e2c7236ac716341c959511ce37.jpg","localized_name":"Dry Waters","name":"Dry Waters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/858870/d3a6e2ec5a76b3e2c7236ac716341c959511ce37.jpg"},{"icon":"668547f9972da0e23a82793d422ec9c37268624c.jpg","localized_name":"Unexpected Shipwreck","name":"Unexpected Shipwreck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/858870/668547f9972da0e23a82793d422ec9c37268624c.jpg"},{"icon":"9db14cca292881bf6b6d166af95527249ddd0572.jpg","localized_name":"The prince is the beggar","name":"The prince is the beggar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/858870/9db14cca292881bf6b6d166af95527249ddd0572.jpg"},{"icon":"24f4d1b3fc07a204e7d4a31a1b8dfea6b783b2e0.jpg","localized_name":"Caught by a shark","name":"Caught by a shark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/858870/24f4d1b3fc07a204e7d4a31a1b8dfea6b783b2e0.jpg"},{"icon":"2e6351691552d6d892301baa32430e239eea0f06.jpg","localized_name":"Twenty years of loneliness","na